#version 450
#extension GL_EXT_samplerless_texture_functions : require
// GTAO replacement for the game's HDAO main pass (BioShock Infinite recomp, Quest 3).
//
// Ground-truth ambient occlusion after Jimenez et al. 2016 ("Practical Real-Time Strategies for Accurate Indirect
// Occlusion") as implemented in Intel XeGTAO (https://github.com/GameTechDev/XeGTAO), adapted to a single compute pass
// that reads the game's own inputs. The slice setup, horizon search, falloff, inner integral, FastACos structure and
// the depth-normal reconstruction follow XeGTAO's XeGTAO_MainPass / XeGTAO_CalculateNormal, which carry this license:
//
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
